  "investigation": "The experimental framesync state used AV_NOPTS sentinel internally. The Native stack graph emitted MIN+1 at unknown event times; production integration needs distinct internal-event and stack-output rescaling semantics, including EOF acknowledgement. This fixture is evidence of unfinished work, not passing compatibility.",
